{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/extras/gem_long_desc.jpg?t=1745944426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deer Crusade is a 2D Metroidvania adventure where exploration, combat, and puzzle-solving guide the journey home. Take the role of a cursed child searching for scattered gem shards across a vast, mysterious world inspired by Mayan mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain powerful abilities, face off against challenging bosses, and uncover hidden secrets in a handcrafted world rich with environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/extras/combat_long_desc.jpg?t=1745944426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/extras/recover_long_desc.jpg?t=1745944426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From intense battles to quiet moments of discovery, Deer Crusade invites you into a journey that\u2019s as challenging as it is unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/extras/danger_long_desc.jpg?t=1745944426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/extras/hammock_long_desc.jpg?t=1745944426\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2286580?t=1745944426","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/89008b0949624799fc5d3b53e4846593a869c130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745944426","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2286580/b0fe407e98a8014471d228dabc60847aa5911eb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745944426","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.